#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0290B expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
#note "DISCRIMINATING FIXTURE, half 2 of the AD0290B-F1 pair; also the batch's single pin on the [OCCURRENCE DATA STRUCTURE]-alone block that AD0290B carries ALONE. Columns/rows BYTE-IDENTICAL to PMDA-AD0289B-invalid_bds_structure-ADLBC.cdt - the table would fire under this Check (key AREL=RELATED carries {1,2} -> rows 1,3) but AD0290B's Data_Structures omits BASIC DATA STRUCTURE, so the pre-gate skips a BDS dataset before it ever executes. NEVER re-aim."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AREL    type=Char
col ARELN   type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | RELATED  | 1
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | ALB | UNLIKELY | 1
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1034 | ALB | RELATED  | 2
